{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1d425ec07d83e9f6a0af775403aecc01e9db6f5d78126e3f146a79a8b4128373", "ja": "おーい？　環……あれ、ここにもいないのか……。\nうーん……誰か見てないかな？", "zh": "喂——？ 环……咦，这里也不在吗……  \n嗯……有人看到她了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "58b036ef63ff31f6431cad748584be89eb102ac91eb2a6f7d7a8aee237f6b6f2", "ja": "わあーーーーーっ！", "zh": "哇————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1003_p", "source_sha256": "47c8a318240c0b45910e9cc0e5310bd894139abb87f5fad240932919c6a15c56", "ja": "うわあっ！？", "zh": "唔哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "020c2bfad5b6339baf580bec4ddf18f8ff595f89f34e91e71733b84cd9eeed3c", "ja": "くふふ♪　ねえねえおやぶん、ビックリした？\nたまき、ずっと隠れて待ってたんだ～。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 亲爱的大将，吓了一跳吧？\n环一直藏起来等着你呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "f14eadf7586343764d8d26f3cf95a8fbde49aeabeac67f6bbc1649cce9a47194", "ja": "こういうビックリさせるのって、\nあみやまみがうまいけど、たまきも負けないぞ！", "zh": "像这样吓人，亚美和真美很擅长，不过环也不会输的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4d894fa91f347ee59eb76b75e202c33e4b1de6ddb0534dc403f88e2f7b26cfc2", "ja": "あ、ああ……心臓が止まるかと思ったよ。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……我还以为心脏都要停了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "c824dc8fe670816334a178f757295f519f106ce094590b2bcaef0d52bed6ba86", "ja": "え、ええっ！？　それはダメだぞ！\nおやぶんの心臓、頑張って！　もっと動いてっ！", "zh": "诶、诶诶！？那可不行！\n老大的心脏，加油！再多跳几下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1008_p", "source_sha256": "31f31733103145878ba9ca35b5d113964b73813d8962e64ef3a971bbe1954f23", "ja": "いや、今のはたとえだから……。\nそれくらいビックリしたってことだよ。", "zh": "不是、刚才只是打个比方……  \n就是说，真的有那么吃惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "009ae235c87a58a1d3fbb7a5c7226ade5149a1c6224e76b861f4485dd6485848", "ja": "ほんとう？　よかった……。\nおやぶんの心臓が止まっちゃったら困るぞ～！", "zh": "真的吗？太好了……\n要是老大的心脏停跳了，可就麻烦啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "a7c4b39a021174945c2562599d81d0a57889e29cafe38b53d27d20bca4e9241d", "ja": "こういう風に驚かすのって、よくないのかな？\nたまき、面白いと思ってやったんだけど……。", "zh": "这样吓人是不是不太好？\n环，觉得这样很有意思才这么做的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1011_p", "source_sha256": "64f592899e97a444a58aeebb952474540963fde7668546d42e359bd3ff3a0b9b", "ja": "まあ、ドキッとはするよな……。\n気になるなら、他の驚かせ方を考えてみたらどうだ？", "zh": "嗯，确实会让人吓一跳……  \n要是在意的话，不如想想其他吓人的方式？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9017c6347c1f9944cb2cc5c85ec8db4a0b895e1c4f9c0288254f8bea1376ae7d", "ja": "ワーッてやるだけじゃなくて、\n「え、ウソッ！？」ってなる感じの……。", "zh": "不只是突然“哇——”地吓人，\n而是要有种让人觉得“诶，骗人的吧！？”的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "3f3f7879148ea09ee74d103d0b9e43cfd658e571d0dd6983eafd6072c7f9f7cb", "ja": "あ、それって、あかねやせりかとやった、\nサプライズライブみたいなこと？", "zh": "啊，是指和茜、星梨花一起做过的那种惊喜演出吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ca716b57769be987cd205ff9806502a6b6a59d0874c9dd0e861ebe9abbe32541", "ja": "ああ、そうだな、そういうことだ！", "zh": "啊，没错，就是这么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "2e2439b217dc0c111be47837580e9ac6aea65086acff0a268621d86d1995ec58", "ja": "くふふ！　なるほど、わかったぞ～。\nたまき、そういう驚かせ方を考えてみるね！", "zh": "嘿嘿！原来如此，我明白啦～  \n环想想看那种吓人的方法吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "23e4f9bc3e769c95f2dab05bf1481ec7c9e377f978422f9e2f173171ee198451", "ja": "どんなのがいいかな～？\nたまきが、おいしすぎる料理を作るとか……。", "zh": "做什么样的比较好呢～？\n比如环做出超级好吃的料理……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "860460119dd589b3e300889c71f3a70dd5088bf391019ba5b3ea203289853ed3", "ja": "あっ、すっごくキレイなメイクしてみるとか、\n面白いかな？　くふふ♪", "zh": "啊，或者试试化个特别漂亮的妆，\n会不会很有意思呢？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0353_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "6fb1d598a1a4ff2a4310df854d7cfac85bf43324fe95c8328c6cb0b80ba56e58", "ja": "次は絶対、おやぶんに笑ってもらえるような\nビックリをあげるから、楽しみにしてて！　くふふ♪", "zh": "下次我绝对会给大叔一个能让你笑出来的惊喜，敬请期待哦！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
